# Recorded input for the toolbar example page (widgets/toolbar.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200 in
# the default theme: Bold at 16..66, Italic at 72..138, Underline at 144..236, all at y 16..50.
# Keys are USB HID codes: 79 Right, 80 Left, 74 Home, 44 Space (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest, Bold is the tab stop
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover Italic
frame
pointer 105 33
# 2: press it
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: Italic activated, focused, the tab stop
frame
buttons
# 4: Right: focus and the stop move to Underline
frame
press 79
# 5: Space: Underline activated
frame
press 44
# 6: Home: to Bold
frame
press 74
# 7: Left: wraps to Underline
frame
press 80
